      "updated": 1792929840425,
      "created": 1792929823365,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Get the Model Metadata of the Deployed Model \n\n    - you will be able to get the names of the Features and Outputs\n    - you will be able to get how many Features the Model expects and how many Outputs the Model generates\n    - you will be able to get the shape and Data types the Model is expecting ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° Get the Model Metadata of the Deployed Model \n\n    - you will be able to get the names of the Features and Outputs\n    - you will be able to get how many Features the Model expects and how many Outputs the Model generates\n    - you will be able to get the shape and Data types the Model is expecting ",
