      "updated": 1792929920380,
      "created": 1792929916844,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Verify a Predictive Model is deployed and ready :\n    - Model Deployment has been done by the lab script\n\n° Get the InferenceService name of the deployed Model\n    - you will need it for TrustyAI service instance\n\n° Verify that the TrustyAI-service Pod is Running\n    - This Pod has been created by the TrustyAI Operator\n\n    - Optionally, have a look to the trusyAIservice CR\n      created by the lab script. This is why you have a TrustyAI service instance",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° Verify a Predictive Model is deployed and ready :\n    - Model Deployment has been done by the lab script\n\n° Get the InferenceService name of the deployed Model\n    - you will need it for TrustyAI service instance\n\n° Verify that the TrustyAI-service Pod is Running\n    - This Pod has been created by the TrustyAI Operator\n\n    - Optionally, have a look to the trusyAIservice CR\n      created by the lab script. This is why you have a TrustyAI service instance",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
