      "updated": 1792930022532,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "List available metric monitoring requests\n\n\nYou can also remove monitoring requests:\n    curl -k -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" -X DELETE --location \"$TRUSTY_ROUTE/metrics/drift/meanshift/request\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\n          \\\"requestId\\\": \\\"1b3fa481-d116-487e-9c4a-1b00224c4d24\\\"\n        }\"",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "List available metric monitoring requests\n\n\nYou can also remove monitoring requests:\n    curl -k -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" -X DELETE --location \"$TRUSTY_ROUTE/metrics/drift/meanshift/request\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\n          \\\"requestId\\\": \\\"1b3fa481-d116-487e-9c4a-1b00224c4d24\\\"\n        }\"",
